    "detailed_description": "<br><br><br>Toilet Party is a 2-8 player online and local-multiplayer party game. Toilet friendships in the entertaining collection of +70 unique minigames.<br><br><strong>ONLINE &amp; LOCAL MULTIPLAYER</strong><br>Play how you want. Toilet Party allows 2 to 8 players to compete both online or locally on the same screen. Whether it's online, or in person, it's all the same friendship ruining fun.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859880/extras/54705ed5e71a082d5743f838070759d9.poster.avif?t=1729775839\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859880/extras/54705ed5e71a082d5743f838070759d9.webm?t=1729775839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859880/extras/54705ed5e71a082d5743f838070759d9.mp4?t=1729775839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>MINI GAMES</strong><br>From simple nostalgic fun to unique and evolutionary Toilet Party contains a wide array of exciting minigames. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859880/extras/7472bbb9879a4d75389b0a4eb48113d7.poster.avif?t=1729775839\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859880/extras/7472bbb9879a4d75389b0a4eb48113d7.webm?t=1729775839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859880/extras/7472bbb9879a4d75389b0a4eb48113d7.mp4?t=1729775839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>MINI GAME MODE</strong><br>Just want to jump in to the action? Toilet Party includes a minigame mode so that you can get straight to the games!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859880/extras/e2ceb70d99058b9e790d8a19d07dcb83.poster.avif?t=1729775839\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859880/extras/e2ceb70d99058b9e790d8a19d07dcb83.webm?t=1729775839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859880/extras/e2ceb70d99058b9e790d8a19d07dcb83.mp4?t=1729775839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>ITEMS</strong><br>It's all out toilet! Use an array of absurd weapons and objects to claw your way to victory. From the simple 'shitball' to the ridiculous 'toilet plunger' the items in Toilet Party will lead to many funny and rage inducing moments. It's never been easier or more satisfying to crush your friends aspirations of winning!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859880/extras/a33efb99f8d83334015acc66e2689fc1.poster.avif?t=1729775839\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859880/extras/a33efb99f8d83334015acc66e2689fc1.webm?t=1729775839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859880/extras/a33efb99f8d83334015acc66e2689fc1.mp4?t=1729775839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
